<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 7.6 percent in the week ended May 9, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 4.7 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 8.3 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index rose 4.7 percent to 303.4 from 289.8 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index rose 8.3 percent to 205.1 in the latest survey from 189.4 in the previous week.  </p>
